      en: ["Average elevation between 400 and 500 meters", "Part of the ancient Precambrian African Shield", "Features prominent granite inselberg formations", "Key region for industrial cotton farming", "Dominated by the dry Harmattan wind in winter", "Strategic trade location near Mali and Guinea borders"],
